    "finalName": "",
    "description": "If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pistol\">Pistol</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rifle\">Rifle</a>, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flanking\" title=\"Flanking\">Flanking</a> that target.<br><br>You may only be considered to be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flanking\" title=\"Flanking\">Flanking</a> a single target at a time. You must spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> on your turn to designate the target you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flank\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flank\">Flank</a> at range.",
